OL,3,GNEWSACustomers split on response to
OL,4,Amajor water outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA customer hit by a major water outage
OL,7,Fsays she has placed water containers
OL,8,Faround her house in case it happens
OL,9,Fagain.
OL,11,FAnglian Water is holding community
OL,12,Fdrop-in sessions after about 36,000
OL,13,Fpeople were cut off or had low supply
OL,14,Fwhen two pipes burst in the Scunthorpe
OL,15,Farea on 16 September.
OL,17,FLorraine Mary Cabell, 76, from Kirton
OL,18,Fin Lindsey, described the firm's
OL,19,Fresponse as "haphazard" and said she
OL,20,Fdid not believe it was prepared for an
OL,21,Fincident on such a "vast scale".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
