OL,3,GNEWSACustomers split on response to
OL,4,Amajor water outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatasha Tuke, an outreach manager at
OL,7,FAnglian Water, said: "There will
OL,8,Fundoubtedly be areas we could have done
OL,9,Fbetter. We want to hear what we didn't
OL,10,Fget right so we can make sure we get
OL,11,Fthat right in the future."
